{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13131","headline":"答张諲刘方平兼呈贺兰广 · 皇甫冉","name":"答张諲刘方平兼呈贺兰广","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野性难驯狎，荒郊自闭门。\n心闲同海鸟，日夕恋山村。\n屡枉琼瑶赠，如今道术存。\n远峯时振策，春雨耐香源。\n复有故人在，宁闻庐鹊喧。\n青青草色绿，终是待王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}